{"id":"twitter:1817330478254342490","tweet_id":"1817330478254342490","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1817330478254342490","title":"@RadioFreeTom @FPWellman Oh I scrolled up and saw the QT about the bullet. Snopes did an article on that and the homosectionality. JD Vance is Thiel's","summary":"@RadioFreeTom @FPWellman Oh I scrolled up and saw the QT about the bullet. Snopes did an article on that and the homosectionality. JD Vance is Thiel's Fash Errand Boy and deserves all the mocking. We all know it's not true. Couch will go out of style soon Then we return to Diet Mountain Dew https://t.co/1LvW0bZ61n","date":"2024-07-27","published":"2024-07-27T22:45:25+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/RadioFreeTom/status/1817329549665010030","reply_tweet_id":"1817329549665010030","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@RadioFreeTom @FPWellman Oh I scrolled up and saw the QT about the bullet.<br><br>Snopes did an article on that and the homosectionality.<br><br>JD Vance is Thiel&#x27;s Fash Errand Boy and deserves all the mocking.<br><br>We all know it&#x27;s not true. Couch will go out of style soon<br><br>Then we return to Diet Mountain Dew <a href=\"https://t.co/1LvW0bZ61n\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/1LvW0bZ61n</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/d00cfae8087d1c67630cce5f45401392.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1817330478254342490","display_date":"July 27, 2024 · 22:45 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/d00cfae8087d1c67630cce5f45401392.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1817329058805367159","tweet_id":"1817329058805367159","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1817329058805367159","title":"@RadioFreeTom @FPWellman No. What Snopes said it wasn't a fragment of a Teleprompter. Because it wasn't Snopes never refuted the claim \"shot by a bull","summary":"@RadioFreeTom @FPWellman No. What Snopes said it wasn't a fragment of a Teleprompter. Because it wasn't Snopes never refuted the claim \"shot by a bullet that pierced the upper part of the right ear\" Not once","date":"2024-07-27","published":"2024-07-27T22:39:46+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/RadioFreeTom/status/1817301122517971134","reply_tweet_id":"1817301122517971134","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@RadioFreeTom @FPWellman No.<br><br>What Snopes said it wasn&#x27;t a fragment of a Teleprompter.<br><br>Because it wasn&#x27;t<br><br>Snopes never refuted the claim &quot;shot by a bullet that pierced the upper part of the right ear&quot;<br><br>Not once</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1817329058805367159","display_date":"July 27, 2024 · 22:39 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1817328771864649877","tweet_id":"1817328771864649877","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1817328771864649877","title":"@RadioFreeTom @FPWellman If it is a cruel joke why is Trump's ear bandaged this way and why is he saying he took a \"bullet for us\" I have been reading","summary":"@RadioFreeTom @FPWellman If it is a cruel joke why is Trump's ear bandaged this way and why is he saying he took a \"bullet for us\" I have been reading Criminal code, crime statistics, and civil case law. I do not think Trump's wound would be classified as a gunshot wound. Happy to be proven wrong. https://t.co/2VlD6jmqBr","date":"2024-07-27","published":"2024-07-27T22:38:38+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/RadioFreeTom/status/1817301122517971134","reply_tweet_id":"1817301122517971134","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@RadioFreeTom @FPWellman If it is a cruel joke why is Trump&#x27;s ear bandaged this way and why is he saying he took a &quot;bullet for us&quot;<br><br>I have been reading Criminal code, crime statistics, and civil case law.<br><br>I do not think Trump&#x27;s wound would be classified as a gunshot wound.<br><br>Happy to be proven wrong. <a href=\"https://t.co/2VlD6jmqBr\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/2VlD6jmqBr</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/b4e71934d37498dd4103319b609064ca.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1817328771864649877","display_date":"July 27, 2024 · 22:38 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/b4e71934d37498dd4103319b609064ca.jpg"]}
