{"id":"twitter:1816271047190057424","tweet_id":"1816271047190057424","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1816271047190057424","title":"Good case study from @KnowBe4 if you like making tabletops. I would include job application, resume sharing, and DMs on LinkedIn. Good way to suck up ","summary":"Good case study from @KnowBe4 if you like making tabletops. I would include job application, resume sharing, and DMs on LinkedIn. Good way to suck up data for social engineering. https://blog.knowbe4.com/how-a-north-korean-fake-it-worker-tried-to-infiltrate-us","date":"2024-07-25","published":"2024-07-25T00:35:36+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Good case study from @KnowBe4 if you like making tabletops.<br><br>I would include job application, resume sharing, and DMs on LinkedIn. Good way to suck up data for social engineering.<br><br><a href=\"https://blog.knowbe4.com/how-a-north-korean-fake-it-worker-tried-to-infiltrate-us\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://blog.knowbe4.com/how-a-north-korean-fake-it-worker-tried-to-infiltrate-us</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816271047190057424","display_date":"July 25, 2024 · 00:35 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1816268648274673701","tweet_id":"1816268648274673701","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1816268648274673701","title":"@PatriotKisses @harrisonjaime @BaddCompani Avoid legal challenges by sticking within existing legal framework. Just a guess. It doesn't really matter ","summary":"@PatriotKisses @harrisonjaime @BaddCompani Avoid legal challenges by sticking within existing legal framework. Just a guess. It doesn't really matter the FEC is useless at 3-3 tie, and law, I believe, is you can't go to court until FEC adjudicates. But conventions your appendix. It's there but people don't know why.","date":"2024-07-25","published":"2024-07-25T00:26:05+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/PatriotKisses/status/1816267281803943988","reply_tweet_id":"1816267281803943988","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PatriotKisses @harrisonjaime @BaddCompani Avoid legal challenges by sticking within existing legal framework.<br><br>Just a guess.<br><br>It doesn&#x27;t really matter the FEC is useless at 3-3 tie, and law, I believe, is you can&#x27;t go to court until FEC adjudicates.<br><br>But conventions your appendix. It&#x27;s there but people don&#x27;t know why.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816268648274673701","display_date":"July 25, 2024 · 00:26 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
