{"id":"twitter:1816261367902724237","tweet_id":"1816261367902724237","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1816261367902724237","title":"@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree And this requirement of third party assessors, that is new and may spread to other Departments and Agencies. fi","summary":"@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree And this requirement of third party assessors, that is new and may spread to other Departments and Agencies. first real cyber for Defense Contractors was DFARS 7000 series. just finished federal rule making for CMMC program to assess. I'll send the NIST courses. Good stuff","date":"2024-07-24","published":"2024-07-24T23:57:09+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816260576084963706","reply_tweet_id":"1816260576084963706","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree And this requirement of third party assessors, that is new and may spread to other Departments and Agencies.<br><br> first real cyber for Defense Contractors was DFARS 7000 series.<br><br>just finished federal rule making for CMMC program to assess.<br><br>I&#x27;ll send the NIST courses. Good stuff</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816261367902724237","display_date":"July 24, 2024 · 23:57 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1816260576084963706","tweet_id":"1816260576084963706","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1816260576084963706","title":"@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree But again... In terms of FISMA OMB has determined that contractors only responsible for the confidentiality of ","summary":"@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree But again... In terms of FISMA OMB has determined that contractors only responsible for the confidentiality of the assets. NIST-SP-800-171 is subset of controls selected from NIST-SP-800-53 catalog. But hard to be compliant without full security and Risk management program","date":"2024-07-24","published":"2024-07-24T23:54:00+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816254193877016728","reply_tweet_id":"1816254193877016728","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree But again... In terms of FISMA OMB has determined that contractors  only responsible for the confidentiality of the assets.<br><br>NIST-SP-800-171 is subset of controls selected from  NIST-SP-800-53 catalog.<br><br>But  hard to be compliant without full security and Risk management program</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816260576084963706","display_date":"July 24, 2024 · 23:54 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
