{"id":"twitter:1816243941181665776","tweet_id":"1816243941181665776","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1816243941181665776","title":"@skitzotard @yzy_is_who @tmclaughbos @IwriteOK That's also under the assumption Twitter functions on a good day. The OGP themselves deleted tweet sayi","summary":"@skitzotard @yzy_is_who @tmclaughbos @IwriteOK That's also under the assumption Twitter functions on a good day. The OGP themselves deleted tweet saying they had not verified it. It's unauthorized access to a screen cap of authorization and access (that's somehow an Approve List...)","date":"2024-07-24","published":"2024-07-24T22:47:54+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/skitzotard/status/1816242896254771647","reply_tweet_id":"1816242896254771647","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@skitzotard @yzy_is_who @tmclaughbos @IwriteOK That&#x27;s also under the assumption Twitter functions on a good day.<br><br>The OGP themselves deleted tweet saying they had not verified it.<br><br>It&#x27;s unauthorized access to a screen cap of authorization and access<br><br>(that&#x27;s somehow an Approve List...)</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816243941181665776","display_date":"July 24, 2024 · 22:47 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1816242967511724248","tweet_id":"1816242967511724248","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1816242967511724248","title":"@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree As someone who assesses the security of ERM systems, both federal and Non-Federal, that hold Gov assets... You ","summary":"@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree As someone who assesses the security of ERM systems, both federal and Non-Federal, that hold Gov assets... You don't want one ERM to rule them all. Crowdstrike Falcon was an EDR you could choose to have in scope. Look what that did. SPOF = bad","date":"2024-07-24","published":"2024-07-24T22:44:02+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816242456641561094","reply_tweet_id":"1816242456641561094","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree As someone who assesses the security of ERM systems, both federal and Non-Federal, that hold Gov assets... You don&#x27;t want one ERM to rule them all.<br><br>Crowdstrike Falcon was an EDR you could choose to have in scope.<br><br>Look what that did.<br><br>SPOF = bad</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816242967511724248","display_date":"July 24, 2024 · 22:44 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1816242456641561094","tweet_id":"1816242456641561094","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1816242456641561094","title":"@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree Yes. There is someone in every Federal agency trained in Risk Management. Every project that touches federal da","summary":"@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree Yes. There is someone in every Federal agency trained in Risk Management. Every project that touches federal data has an FSo You should find what Portman and Peters proposed with risk based budgeting. It got closest to what you want in current legal framework.","date":"2024-07-24","published":"2024-07-24T22:42:00+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/dianesbaker1/status/1816241413291684192","reply_tweet_id":"1816241413291684192","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree Yes.<br><br>There is someone in every Federal agency trained in Risk Management.<br><br>Every project that touches federal data has an FSo<br><br>You should find what Portman and Peters proposed with risk based budgeting. It got closest to what you want in current legal framework.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816242456641561094","display_date":"July 24, 2024 · 22:42 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1816241221507113229","tweet_id":"1816241221507113229","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1816241221507113229","title":"@skitzotard @yzy_is_who @tmclaughbos @IwriteOK Accounts break all the time. Never know why your reach is throttled today. Now if someone had an instan","summary":"@skitzotard @yzy_is_who @tmclaughbos @IwriteOK Accounts break all the time. Never know why your reach is throttled today. Now if someone had an instance of Twitter running locally.. Maybe. But why would you query the OKTA API with plain text over http?","date":"2024-07-24","published":"2024-07-24T22:37:05+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/skitzotard/status/1816239662240780426","reply_tweet_id":"1816239662240780426","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@skitzotard @yzy_is_who @tmclaughbos @IwriteOK Accounts break all the time. Never know why your reach is throttled today.<br><br>Now if someone had an instance of Twitter running locally.. Maybe.<br><br>But why would you query the OKTA API with plain text over http?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816241221507113229","display_date":"July 24, 2024 · 22:37 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1816239882710417819","tweet_id":"1816239882710417819","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1816239882710417819","title":"@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree I know what an ERM is and one ERM for the entire Gov sounds like the worst SPOF ever. And the folks who develop","summary":"@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree I know what an ERM is and one ERM for the entire Gov sounds like the worst SPOF ever. And the folks who develop data analytics for Gov become their own risk. Shunned developers worse (Thin thread)","date":"2024-07-24","published":"2024-07-24T22:31:46+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/dianesbaker1/status/1816239186128822692","reply_tweet_id":"1816239186128822692","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree I know what an ERM is and one ERM for the entire Gov sounds like the worst SPOF ever.<br><br>And the folks who develop data analytics for Gov become their own risk. Shunned developers worse (Thin thread)</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816239882710417819","display_date":"July 24, 2024 · 22:31 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1816239422310080573","tweet_id":"1816239422310080573","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1816239422310080573","title":"One downfall with having your trust algo stepped on. It's kinda hard for folks to see replies when you explain something you post has not been verifie","summary":"One downfall with having your trust algo stepped on. It's kinda hard for folks to see replies when you explain something you post has not been verified. Guess we gotta couch that problem.","date":"2024-07-24","published":"2024-07-24T22:29:57+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>One downfall with having your trust algo stepped on. It&#x27;s kinda hard for folks to see replies when you explain something you post has not been verified.<br><br>Guess we gotta couch that problem.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816239422310080573","display_date":"July 24, 2024 · 22:29 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
