{"id":"twitter:1816238278355583123","tweet_id":"1816238278355583123","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1816238278355583123","title":"@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree But to change what you want means rewriting the Constitution. There is no ERM law you can write above the Const","summary":"@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree But to change what you want means rewriting the Constitution. There is no ERM law you can write above the Constitution. The Leo-Barr theory of unitary executive now pervasive in Courts further limits \"ERM\" each branch can put on the other","date":"2024-07-24","published":"2024-07-24T22:25:24+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/dianesbaker1/status/1816237202793455644","reply_tweet_id":"1816237202793455644","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree But to change what you want means rewriting the Constitution.<br><br>There is no ERM law you can write above the Constitution.<br><br>The Leo-Barr theory of unitary executive now pervasive in Courts further limits &quot;ERM&quot; each branch can put on the other</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816238278355583123","display_date":"July 24, 2024 · 22:25 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1816237558667567594","tweet_id":"1816237558667567594","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1816237558667567594","title":"@tmclaughbos @yzy_is_who @IwriteOK And legal ain't letting you do this in plain text and regex.... Get outta here.... Lawyers gonna CYA...especially o","summary":"@tmclaughbos @yzy_is_who @IwriteOK And legal ain't letting you do this in plain text and regex.... Get outta here.... Lawyers gonna CYA...especially on \"allow n**ger\" from these accounts. The HTTP is sus AF. Even in local Dev environments with a sandboxed connection you ain't connecting to OKTA","date":"2024-07-24","published":"2024-07-24T22:22:32+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/tmclaughbos/status/1816235677744288172","reply_tweet_id":"1816235677744288172","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@tmclaughbos @yzy_is_who @IwriteOK And legal ain&#x27;t letting you do this in plain text and regex.... Get outta here.... Lawyers gonna CYA...especially on &quot;allow n**ger&quot; from these accounts.<br><br>The HTTP is sus AF. Even in local Dev environments with a sandboxed connection you ain&#x27;t connecting to OKTA</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816237558667567594","display_date":"July 24, 2024 · 22:22 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1816237000439259639","tweet_id":"1816237000439259639","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1816237000439259639","title":"@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree @CISAgov As any President can. I have no idea if Leo ever had a security clearance. By definition that stuff is","summary":"@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree @CISAgov As any President can. I have no idea if Leo ever had a security clearance. By definition that stuff is not advertised but a President can authorize release of anything to any Tom, Dick, and Harry. It doesn't mean other laws or regulations can be ignored.","date":"2024-07-24","published":"2024-07-24T22:20:19+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/dianesbaker1/status/1816235367781339152","reply_tweet_id":"1816235367781339152","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree @CISAgov As any President can. I have no idea if Leo ever had a security clearance.<br><br>By definition that stuff is not advertised but a President can authorize release of anything to any Tom, Dick, and Harry.<br><br>It doesn&#x27;t mean other laws or regulations can be ignored.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816237000439259639","display_date":"July 24, 2024 · 22:20 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
