{"id":"twitter:1816233070258995520","tweet_id":"1816233070258995520","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1816233070258995520","title":"@Fella_IA_X25 @ylecun @theliamnissan @Anna_lena2022 @P_Kallioniemi @FlorianBayer @okta I still say fake. OKTA wouldn't allow it in a million years.","summary":"@Fella_IA_X25 @ylecun @theliamnissan @Anna_lena2022 @P_Kallioniemi @FlorianBayer @okta I still say fake. OKTA wouldn't allow it in a million years.","date":"2024-07-24","published":"2024-07-24T22:04:42+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Fella_IA_X25/status/1816232248770719792","reply_tweet_id":"1816232248770719792","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Fella_IA_X25 @ylecun @theliamnissan @Anna_lena2022 @P_Kallioniemi @FlorianBayer @okta I still say fake.<br><br>OKTA wouldn&#x27;t allow it in a million years.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816233070258995520","display_date":"July 24, 2024 · 22:04 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1816232119783297283","tweet_id":"1816232119783297283","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1816232119783297283","title":"@LongAsUCan2 @dianesbaker1 @RickPetree Well Portman and Peters had a FISMA reauthorization that introduced risk based budgeting but Freedom Caucus kil","summary":"@LongAsUCan2 @dianesbaker1 @RickPetree Well Portman and Peters had a FISMA reauthorization that introduced risk based budgeting but Freedom Caucus killed it. NARA is related to FISMA in as much as they decide how Gov assets not meant for public release get labeled. Say Ornato's missing text messages for example","date":"2024-07-24","published":"2024-07-24T22:00:55+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/LongAsUCan2/status/1816231324384125283","reply_tweet_id":"1816231324384125283","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@LongAsUCan2 @dianesbaker1 @RickPetree Well Portman and Peters had a FISMA reauthorization that introduced risk based budgeting but Freedom Caucus killed it.<br><br>NARA is related to FISMA in as much as they decide how Gov assets not meant for public release get labeled.<br><br>Say Ornato&#x27;s missing text messages for example</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816232119783297283","display_date":"July 24, 2024 · 22:00 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1816231481657745893","tweet_id":"1816231481657745893","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1816231481657745893","title":"@Fella_IA_X25 @ylecun @theliamnissan @Anna_lena2022 @P_Kallioniemi @FlorianBayer @okta Why I am leaning towards fake. You would hash these phrases and","summary":"@Fella_IA_X25 @ylecun @theliamnissan @Anna_lena2022 @P_Kallioniemi @FlorianBayer @okta Why I am leaning towards fake. You would hash these phrases and not use plain text and regex Nor a third party authentication API. A lot seems strange. Let alone no lawyer would allow it.","date":"2024-07-24","published":"2024-07-24T21:58:23+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Fella_IA_X25/status/1816229710457708785","reply_tweet_id":"1816229710457708785","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Fella_IA_X25 @ylecun @theliamnissan @Anna_lena2022 @P_Kallioniemi @FlorianBayer @okta Why I am leaning towards fake. You would hash these phrases and not use plain text and regex<br><br>Nor a third party authentication API.<br><br>A lot seems strange.<br><br>Let alone no lawyer would allow it.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816231481657745893","display_date":"July 24, 2024 · 21:58 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1816231019739046128","tweet_id":"1816231019739046128","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1816231019739046128","title":"@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree transactions are different and would be covered by SEC rules. They aren't Gov assets but new @CISAgov rules aro","summary":"@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree transactions are different and would be covered by SEC rules. They aren't Gov assets but new @CISAgov rules around critical infrastructure, secure by design, and the SBOMs from Executive Orders impact Fintech immensely on legal shaky ground already. Chevron may have borked","date":"2024-07-24","published":"2024-07-24T21:56:33+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/dianesbaker1/status/1816228864953405829","reply_tweet_id":"1816228864953405829","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree transactions are different and would be covered by SEC rules. They aren&#x27;t Gov assets <br><br>but new @CISAgov rules around critical infrastructure, secure by design, and the SBOMs from Executive Orders impact Fintech immensely<br><br> on legal shaky ground already. Chevron may have borked</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816231019739046128","display_date":"July 24, 2024 · 21:56 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1816230180597170217","tweet_id":"1816230180597170217","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1816230180597170217","title":"@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree Gets complicated because people use word FIPS to mean encryption... Because FIPS-200 sets minimum Without getti","summary":"@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree Gets complicated because people use word FIPS to mean encryption... Because FIPS-200 sets minimum Without getting technical it means \"lock files this way\" Take Cloudstrike Falcon. When it borked devices they encrypted using Bitlocker that is FIPS validated","date":"2024-07-24","published":"2024-07-24T21:53:13+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816229326167371905","reply_tweet_id":"1816229326167371905","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree Gets complicated because people use  word FIPS to mean encryption... Because FIPS-200 sets minimum <br><br>Without getting technical it means &quot;lock files this way&quot;<br><br>Take Cloudstrike Falcon. When it borked devices they encrypted using Bitlocker that is FIPS validated</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816230180597170217","display_date":"July 24, 2024 · 21:53 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1816229326167371905","tweet_id":"1816229326167371905","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1816229326167371905","title":"@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree Then OMB-130 A circular tells rest of Executive how to meet minium requirements of FIPS 200 using FIPS 199 clas","summary":"@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree Then OMB-130 A circular tells rest of Executive how to meet minium requirements of FIPS 200 using FIPS 199 classifications. That is where NIST-SP-800-37 comes in, Risk Management Framework. Which is closest to how you are using ERM, but ERM only one part of RMF","date":"2024-07-24","published":"2024-07-24T21:49:49+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816228695155016043","reply_tweet_id":"1816228695155016043","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree Then OMB-130 A circular tells rest of Executive how to meet minium requirements of FIPS 200 using FIPS 199 classifications.<br><br>That is where NIST-SP-800-37 comes in, Risk Management Framework.<br><br>Which is closest to how you are using ERM, but ERM only one part of RMF</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816229326167371905","display_date":"July 24, 2024 · 21:49 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1816228695155016043","tweet_id":"1816228695155016043","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1816228695155016043","title":"@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree It's not a Bible. It's literal law. Super simplified FISMA says Commerce must protect the CIA of assets on Fede","summary":"@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree It's not a Bible. It's literal law. Super simplified FISMA says Commerce must protect the CIA of assets on Federal and Non Federal system. Commerce in turns ask OMB to determine risk. That's FIPS 199 divides risk classification. FIPS 200 addresses minimums for security","date":"2024-07-24","published":"2024-07-24T21:47:19+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816227363706855855","reply_tweet_id":"1816227363706855855","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dianesbaker1 @LongAsUCan2 @RickPetree It&#x27;s not a Bible. It&#x27;s literal law. Super simplified <br><br>FISMA says Commerce must protect the CIA of assets on Federal and Non Federal system.<br><br>Commerce in turns ask OMB to determine risk.<br><br>That&#x27;s FIPS 199 divides risk classification. FIPS 200 addresses minimums for security</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816228695155016043","display_date":"July 24, 2024 · 21:47 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
