{"id":"twitter:1816225931192676861","tweet_id":"1816225931192676861","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1816225931192676861","title":"I am still waiting for confirmation but I think this is fake A: It uses http addres, seems locally installed. No API handshake with OKTA over http. Ju","summary":"I am still waiting for confirmation but I think this is fake A: It uses http addres, seems locally installed. No API handshake with OKTA over http. Just aren't. Even local Dev environments I believe using IP6 at OKTA. B. It violates TOS. They strict. C. Not authentication https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1816219418294374681","date":"2024-07-24","published":"2024-07-24T21:36:20+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>I am still waiting for confirmation but I think this is fake<br><br>A: It uses http addres, seems locally installed. No API handshake with OKTA over http. Just aren&#x27;t. Even local Dev environments I believe using IP6 at OKTA.<br><br>B. It violates TOS. They strict.<br><br>C. Not authentication <a href=\"https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1816219418294374681\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1816219418294374681</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1816225931192676861","display_date":"July 24, 2024 · 21:36 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
