{"id":"twitter:1815051650760909135","tweet_id":"1815051650760909135","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1815051650760909135","title":"@AdamKinzinger I will disagree, though I said saying polls are \"wron\" are wrong -Four months out the margined of error is wide -Need to apply logic. H","summary":"@AdamKinzinger I will disagree, though I said saying polls are \"wron\" are wrong -Four months out the margined of error is wide -Need to apply logic. How many people is a 10% swing in PA and Mi from 2020. It's a lot, and that makes no sense -They can be under sampled in their turn out models","date":"2024-07-21","published":"2024-07-21T15:50:10+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/AdamKinzinger/status/1815050965738791087","reply_tweet_id":"1815050965738791087","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@AdamKinzinger I will disagree, though I said saying polls are &quot;wron&quot; are wrong<br><br>-Four months out the margined of error is wide<br>-Need to apply logic. How many people is a 10% swing in PA and Mi from 2020. It&#x27;s a lot, and that makes no sense<br>-They can be under sampled in their turn out models</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1815051650760909135","display_date":"July 21, 2024 · 15:50 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
