{"id":"twitter:1815008997046432119","tweet_id":"1815008997046432119","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1815008997046432119","title":"@LondonBel0w5 So for majority of corporate and Public Sector it was a PITA if you had to meet FIPS requirements, AND you used Crowdstrike Falcon, and ","summary":"@LondonBel0w5 So for majority of corporate and Public Sector it was a PITA if you had to meet FIPS requirements, AND you used Crowdstrike Falcon, and Bitlocker for FIPS...HUUUGE PITA you would need assets above impact level four. MSFT had no part in it. Bitlocker did what it's supposed to","date":"2024-07-21","published":"2024-07-21T13:00:40+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1815008291635728444","reply_tweet_id":"1815008291635728444","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@LondonBel0w5 So for majority of corporate and Public Sector it was a PITA<br><br> if you had to meet FIPS requirements, AND you used Crowdstrike Falcon, and Bitlocker for FIPS...HUUUGE PITA<br><br>you would need assets above impact level four.<br><br>MSFT had no part in it. Bitlocker did what it&#x27;s supposed to</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1815008997046432119","display_date":"July 21, 2024 · 13:00 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
