{"id":"twitter:1814299310613225496","tweet_id":"1814299310613225496","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1814299310613225496","title":"@Porkshop09 It's bad, but no attack or exfiltration. Just huge PITA Crowdstrike Falcon is a tool for Public Sector. The fix isn easy unless you use Bi","summary":"@Porkshop09 It's bad, but no attack or exfiltration. Just huge PITA Crowdstrike Falcon is a tool for Public Sector. The fix isn easy unless you use Bitlocker. Then you have to manually decrypt each machine. Ohh most people are using Bitlocker in critical industries. https://t.co/1boMtUEJoj","date":"2024-07-19","published":"2024-07-19T14:00:38+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1814297743357309386","reply_tweet_id":"1814297743357309386","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Porkshop09 It&#x27;s bad, but no attack or exfiltration. Just huge PITA <br><br>Crowdstrike Falcon is a tool for Public Sector.<br><br>The fix isn easy unless you use Bitlocker.<br><br>Then you have to manually decrypt each machine.<br><br>Ohh most people are using Bitlocker in critical industries. <a href=\"https://t.co/1boMtUEJoj\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/1boMtUEJoj</a></p><p><a href=\"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1814299310613225496\">Watch the video in the original tweet</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1814299310613225496","display_date":"July 19, 2024 · 14:00 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
