{"id":"twitter:2039004177704075524","tweet_id":"2039004177704075524","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2039004177704075524","title":"@techspence This is great EDR is a basic requirement of most basic cyber insurance programs now. It's why ton of people have an EDR that they do not k","summary":"@techspence This is great EDR is a basic requirement of most basic cyber insurance programs now. It's why ton of people have an EDR that they do not know how to use They have to have an EDR to get a policy that won't provide coverage when auditors learn the EDR was misconfigured","date":"2026-03-31","published":"2026-03-31T15:37:33+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/techspence/status/2038997501517205509","reply_tweet_id":"2038997501517205509","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@techspence This is great <br><br>EDR  is a basic requirement of most basic cyber insurance programs now.<br><br>It&#x27;s why ton of people have an EDR that they do not know how to use<br><br>They have to have an EDR to get a policy that won&#x27;t provide coverage when auditors learn the EDR was misconfigured</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2039004177704075524","display_date":"March 31, 2026 · 15:37 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
