{"id":"twitter:1814062150245081500","tweet_id":"1814062150245081500","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1814062150245081500","title":"@noninjaskillz @attorneygeneral @FEC @CISAgov @StateDept It's history. You need to pick a date range as part of your inclusion and inclusion. I like 1","summary":"@noninjaskillz @attorneygeneral @FEC @CISAgov @StateDept It's history. You need to pick a date range as part of your inclusion and inclusion. I like 1996 for my work, others use 1978, some 1951, others go back into late 1800s with Protestant Revivalists There isn't a correct answer. And it's not usually a conspiracy. Just history","date":"2024-07-18","published":"2024-07-18T22:18:14+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/noninjaskillz/status/1814060032238981539","reply_tweet_id":"1814060032238981539","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@noninjaskillz @attorneygeneral @FEC @CISAgov @StateDept It&#x27;s history.<br><br>You need to pick a date range as part of your inclusion and inclusion.<br><br>I like 1996 for my work, others use 1978, some 1951, others go back into late 1800s with Protestant Revivalists<br><br>There isn&#x27;t a correct answer. And it&#x27;s not usually a conspiracy. Just history</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1814062150245081500","display_date":"July 18, 2024 · 22:18 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
