{"id":"twitter:1813525242532491769","tweet_id":"1813525242532491769","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1813525242532491769","title":"@kodaiflow @nbcjoe Polls haven't been off by 10% but we have been under sampling in models. Especially likely and new female voters since Dobbs. I lik","summary":"@kodaiflow @nbcjoe Polls haven't been off by 10% but we have been under sampling in models. Especially likely and new female voters since Dobbs. I like to make predictions based on ballot box trends and not polls. Trump gets crushed if OH-6 happens across America","date":"2024-07-17","published":"2024-07-17T10:44:46+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/kodaiflow/status/1813524076779946299","reply_tweet_id":"1813524076779946299","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@kodaiflow @nbcjoe Polls haven&#x27;t been off by 10% but we have been under sampling in models.<br><br>Especially likely and new female voters since Dobbs.<br><br>I like to make predictions based on ballot box trends and not polls.<br><br>Trump gets crushed if OH-6 happens across America</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1813525242532491769","display_date":"July 17, 2024 · 10:44 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
