{"id":"twitter:1813523011816890826","tweet_id":"1813523011816890826","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1813523011816890826","title":"A poll is a genre. A text. As a text, polls always have an author. And authors come with a bias. Some Authors are bought off like Zogby, Rasmussen, an","summary":"A poll is a genre. A text. As a text, polls always have an author. And authors come with a bias. Some Authors are bought off like Zogby, Rasmussen, and Real Clear Politics. Authors use different methods that influence the text they write. Check out crosstabs","date":"2024-07-17","published":"2024-07-17T10:35:54+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>A poll is a genre. A text.<br><br>As a text, polls always have an author.<br><br>And authors come with a bias.<br><br>Some Authors are bought off like Zogby, Rasmussen, and Real Clear Politics.<br><br>Authors use different methods that influence the text they write.<br><br>Check out crosstabs</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1813523011816890826","display_date":"July 17, 2024 · 10:35 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1813521685825360036","tweet_id":"1813521685825360036","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1813521685825360036","title":"Dear Press talking about polls. If a difference is in the margin of error we call that a tie. Thanks for @nbcjoe for explaining that correctly. Trend ","summary":"Dear Press talking about polls. If a difference is in the margin of error we call that a tie. Thanks for @nbcjoe for explaining that correctly. Trend lines and cross tabs matter.","date":"2024-07-17","published":"2024-07-17T10:30:38+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Dear Press talking about polls.<br><br>If a difference is in the margin of error we call that a tie.<br><br>Thanks for @nbcjoe for explaining that correctly.<br><br>Trend lines and cross tabs matter.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1813521685825360036","display_date":"July 17, 2024 · 10:30 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
