{"id":"twitter:1812608811808735736","tweet_id":"1812608811808735736","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1812608811808735736","title":"@louvelune @realDonaldTrump Lying about being shot is kinda a big deal. Maybe victim is not lying. Taking a shot that close to the temple will leave y","summary":"@louvelune @realDonaldTrump Lying about being shot is kinda a big deal. Maybe victim is not lying. Taking a shot that close to the temple will leave you confused. I would like to know if additional physical evidence exist to support the victims claim they were shot by a bullet that pierced the ear.","date":"2024-07-14","published":"2024-07-14T22:03:12+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/louvelune/status/1812608024860590084","reply_tweet_id":"1812608024860590084","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@louvelune @realDonaldTrump Lying about being shot is kinda a big deal.<br><br>Maybe  victim is not lying. Taking a shot that close to the temple will leave you confused.<br><br>I would like to know if additional physical evidence exist to support the victims claim they were shot by a bullet that pierced the ear.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1812608811808735736","display_date":"July 14, 2024 · 22:03 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
