{"id":"twitter:1812463422560182342","tweet_id":"1812463422560182342","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1812463422560182342","title":"@Give_Up_On_Name @FBI Not according to @realDonaldTrump He said his ear was pierced by a bullet. Seems like a fundamental question the @fbi can answer","summary":"@Give_Up_On_Name @FBI Not according to @realDonaldTrump He said his ear was pierced by a bullet. Seems like a fundamental question the @fbi can answer by now. Yes or no? Was the former President shot through the ear. I don't think @realDonaldTrump would lie about being shot.","date":"2024-07-14","published":"2024-07-14T12:25:28+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Give_Up_On_Name/status/1812462360054935612","reply_tweet_id":"1812462360054935612","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Give_Up_On_Name @FBI Not according to @realDonaldTrump<br><br>He said his ear was pierced by a bullet.<br><br>Seems like a fundamental question the @fbi can answer by now.<br><br>Yes or no? Was the former President shot through the ear.<br><br>I don&#x27;t think @realDonaldTrump would lie about being shot.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1812463422560182342","display_date":"July 14, 2024 · 12:25 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
