{"id":"twitter:1812456796486873367","tweet_id":"1812456796486873367","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1812456796486873367","title":"@AmonDi9501 @FBI @realDonaldTrump @SecretService The exact word by @realDonaldTrump was \"pierced\" I am looking for confirmation from @fbi or @SecretSe","summary":"@AmonDi9501 @FBI @realDonaldTrump @SecretService The exact word by @realDonaldTrump was \"pierced\" I am looking for confirmation from @fbi or @SecretService that Donald Trump was actually shot. Be a weird thing to lie about. I will take @realDonaldTrump at his word. But would like confirmation","date":"2024-07-14","published":"2024-07-14T11:59:08+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/AmonDi9501/status/1812455775446368262","reply_tweet_id":"1812455775446368262","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@AmonDi9501 @FBI @realDonaldTrump @SecretService The exact word by @realDonaldTrump was &quot;pierced&quot;<br><br>I am looking for confirmation from @fbi or @SecretService that Donald Trump was actually shot.<br><br>Be a weird thing to lie about. I will take @realDonaldTrump at his word.<br><br>But would like confirmation</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1812456796486873367","display_date":"July 14, 2024 · 11:59 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1812456260693803057","tweet_id":"1812456260693803057","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1812456260693803057","title":"@TomMostlyZen @realDonaldTrump @FBI Isn't that an important detail? @realDonaldTrump said he was shot, but I can't find any official reports from @fbi","summary":"@TomMostlyZen @realDonaldTrump @FBI Isn't that an important detail? @realDonaldTrump said he was shot, but I can't find any official reports from @fbi or @SecretService that confirm this claim.","date":"2024-07-14","published":"2024-07-14T11:57:01+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/TomMostlyZen/status/1812454878687481986","reply_tweet_id":"1812454878687481986","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@TomMostlyZen @realDonaldTrump @FBI Isn&#x27;t that an important detail?<br><br>@realDonaldTrump said he was shot, but I can&#x27;t find any official reports from @fbi or @SecretService that confirm this claim.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1812456260693803057","display_date":"July 14, 2024 · 11:57 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1812455773168877690","tweet_id":"1812455773168877690","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1812455773168877690","title":"@VeneficusMorti @ChYph3r @FBI Not suggesting that at all.. Wrong weapon choice to strategically shoot someone in the ear. Just looking for official co","summary":"@VeneficusMorti @ChYph3r @FBI Not suggesting that at all.. Wrong weapon choice to strategically shoot someone in the ear. Just looking for official confirmation that @realDonaldTrump was actually shot and isn't lying about being shot.","date":"2024-07-14","published":"2024-07-14T11:55:04+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/VeneficusMorti/status/1812454593005027564","reply_tweet_id":"1812454593005027564","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@VeneficusMorti @ChYph3r @FBI Not suggesting that at all.. Wrong weapon choice to strategically shoot someone in the ear.<br><br>Just looking for official confirmation that @realDonaldTrump was actually shot and isn&#x27;t lying about being shot.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1812455773168877690","display_date":"July 14, 2024 · 11:55 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1812455312214913358","tweet_id":"1812455312214913358","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1812455312214913358","title":"@AmonDi9501 @FBI @realDonaldTrump Those were initial reports I saw from first responders as well. But @realDonaldTrump said his ear was pierced by a 5","summary":"@AmonDi9501 @FBI @realDonaldTrump Those were initial reports I saw from first responders as well. But @realDonaldTrump said his ear was pierced by a 5.56×45mm round shot from a 150 yards. I would expect greater tissue damage at that distance. sure by now @fbi and @SecretService have confirmed if Prez shot.","date":"2024-07-14","published":"2024-07-14T11:53:14+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/AmonDi9501/status/1812453787824480472","reply_tweet_id":"1812453787824480472","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@AmonDi9501 @FBI @realDonaldTrump Those were initial reports I saw from first responders as well.<br><br>But @realDonaldTrump said his ear was pierced by a 5.56×45mm round shot from a 150 yards.<br><br>I would expect greater tissue damage at that distance.<br><br> sure by now @fbi and @SecretService have confirmed if Prez shot.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1812455312214913358","display_date":"July 14, 2024 · 11:53 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
