{"id":"twitter:1811844156924318051","tweet_id":"1811844156924318051","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1811844156924318051","title":"I think it is wrong @GlennKesslerWP to assume the sworn Testimony of rape victims is invalid simply because they withdrew their suits. Under what circ","summary":"I think it is wrong @GlennKesslerWP to assume the sworn Testimony of rape victims is invalid simply because they withdrew their suits. Under what circumstances? Were there threats of violence? Did @alandersh do oppo research and slut shame? Why is @Cernovich involved? https://t.co/8gPidXiYeN","date":"2024-07-12","published":"2024-07-12T19:24:44+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1811829733644247121","reply_tweet_id":"1811829733644247121","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>I think it is wrong @GlennKesslerWP to assume the sworn Testimony of rape victims is invalid simply because they withdrew their suits.<br><br>Under what circumstances?<br><br>Were there threats of violence? Did @alandersh do oppo research and slut shame?<br><br>Why is @Cernovich involved? <a href=\"https://t.co/8gPidXiYeN\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/8gPidXiYeN</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/8389126028d0b050c6a4383162677efd.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1811844156924318051","display_date":"July 12, 2024 · 19:24 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/8389126028d0b050c6a4383162677efd.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1811843596405891478","tweet_id":"1811843596405891478","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1811843596405891478","title":"@taradublinrocks @GlennKesslerWP @AlanDersh @Cernovich That is what @GlennKesslerWP fails to cover. This all goes back to violating the Criminal Victi","summary":"@taradublinrocks @GlennKesslerWP @AlanDersh @Cernovich That is what @GlennKesslerWP fails to cover. This all goes back to violating the Criminal Victims Right Act. That is how the women sued and it is all based on @alandersh NPA he negotiated and with Alexander Acosta. Trump's Secretary of Labor.","date":"2024-07-12","published":"2024-07-12T19:22:30+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1811842733193187382","reply_tweet_id":"1811842733193187382","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@taradublinrocks @GlennKesslerWP @AlanDersh @Cernovich That is what @GlennKesslerWP fails to cover.<br><br>This all goes back to violating the Criminal Victims Right Act.<br><br>That is how the women sued and it is all based on @alandersh NPA he negotiated and with Alexander Acosta.<br><br>Trump&#x27;s Secretary of Labor.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1811843596405891478","display_date":"July 12, 2024 · 19:22 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
