{"id":"twitter:1810729327480254476","tweet_id":"1810729327480254476","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1810729327480254476","title":"What is extra neat is this is a sanctions case for bot farms. Really good to see the action taken. Basically to get a search warrant the FBI traced th","summary":"What is extra neat is this is a sanctions case for bot farms. Really good to see the action taken. Basically to get a search warrant the FBI traced the DNS of all the accounts making trolls. It is a walking indictment, and a good read if bots are your thing https://t.co/JSKv17cieA","date":"2024-07-09","published":"2024-07-09T17:34:48+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1810727360070652362","reply_tweet_id":"1810727360070652362","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>What is extra neat is this is a sanctions case for bot farms. Really good to see the action taken.<br><br>Basically to get a search warrant the FBI traced the DNS of all the accounts making trolls.<br><br>It is a walking indictment, and a good read if bots are your thing <a href=\"https://t.co/JSKv17cieA\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/JSKv17cieA</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/72cf6f747518ab981ecb3780f34d69b0.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1810729327480254476","display_date":"July 09, 2024 · 17:34 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/72cf6f747518ab981ecb3780f34d69b0.png"]}
