{"id":"twitter:1810323354651361726","tweet_id":"1810323354651361726","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1810323354651361726","title":"Gilder was big in in the New York investments scene and hung with those at the Manhattan Institute trying to privatize social security and public educ","summary":"Gilder was big in in the New York investments scene and hung with those at the Manhattan Institute trying to privatize social security and public education https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1776596729258725679","date":"2024-07-08","published":"2024-07-08T14:41:36+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1810322395779231817","reply_tweet_id":"1810322395779231817","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Gilder was big in in the New York investments scene and hung with those at the Manhattan Institute trying to privatize social security and public education<br><br><a href=\"https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1776596729258725679\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1776596729258725679</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1810323354651361726","display_date":"July 08, 2024 · 14:41 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1810322395779231817","tweet_id":"1810322395779231817","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1810322395779231817","title":"Club For Growth was Started by Richard Gilder. He had started a group called \"Political Club for Growth\" and a company called Gilder Gagnon Howe & Com","summary":"Club For Growth was Started by Richard Gilder. He had started a group called \"Political Club for Growth\" and a company called Gilder Gagnon Howe & Company, Gilder Gagnon Howe & Company would invest, and eventually bankrupt the Texas Rangers with George H Bush https://t.co/nEh689hbXO","date":"2024-07-08","published":"2024-07-08T14:37:47+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1810321350571237721","reply_tweet_id":"1810321350571237721","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Club For Growth was Started by Richard Gilder. He had started a group called &quot;Political Club for Growth&quot; and a company called Gilder Gagnon Howe &amp; Company,<br><br>Gilder Gagnon Howe &amp; Company would invest, and eventually bankrupt the Texas Rangers with George H Bush <a href=\"https://t.co/nEh689hbXO\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/nEh689hbXO</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/7c084123678a859d1d73343f0b188595.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1810322395779231817","display_date":"July 08, 2024 · 14:37 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/7c084123678a859d1d73343f0b188595.png"]}
