{"id":"twitter:1809651722513465416","tweet_id":"1809651722513465416","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1809651722513465416","title":"@goa5t At your state level you can advocate for that solution. Elections belong to states, that was clear in Constitution before Chevron. Now? Forget ","summary":"@goa5t At your state level you can advocate for that solution. Elections belong to states, that was clear in Constitution before Chevron. Now? Forget about it. That's why it's dumb. It would get overturned. Then again Court seems loyalty based now too.","date":"2024-07-06","published":"2024-07-06T18:12:47+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1809641404680872126","reply_tweet_id":"1809641404680872126","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@goa5t At your state level you can advocate for that solution. Elections belong to states, that was clear in Constitution before Chevron.<br><br>Now?<br><br>Forget about it.<br><br>That&#x27;s why it&#x27;s dumb. It would get overturned. Then again Court seems loyalty based now too.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1809651722513465416","display_date":"July 06, 2024 · 18:12 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1809650334517579963","tweet_id":"1809650334517579963","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1809650334517579963","title":"@goa5t I have this conversations with teachers all the time. Stop thinking about the plagiarism and start thinking how to teach students to build and ","summary":"@goa5t I have this conversations with teachers all the time. Stop thinking about the plagiarism and start thinking how to teach students to build and train LLMs to write their essays. Would learn way more about text structure that way and build data structures.","date":"2024-07-06","published":"2024-07-06T18:07:16+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1809648107916791993","reply_tweet_id":"1809648107916791993","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@goa5t I have this conversations with teachers all the time. Stop thinking about the plagiarism and start thinking how to teach students to build and train LLMs to write their essays.<br><br>Would learn way more about text structure that way and build data structures.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1809650334517579963","display_date":"July 06, 2024 · 18:07 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
