{"id":"twitter:1809373857268240465","tweet_id":"1809373857268240465","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1809373857268240465","title":"@RealisticPoetry Also an algorithm problem. Twitter hates lists, and sometimes, most times, poems are considered lists. We have been running the hasht","summary":"@RealisticPoetry Also an algorithm problem. Twitter hates lists, and sometimes, most times, poems are considered lists. We have been running the hashtag #smallpoems now for, gosh I think ten years, you need to cultivate a supportive writing community Majority of poetry should suck, math","date":"2024-07-05","published":"2024-07-05T23:48:38+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/RealisticPoetry/status/1809371964576031190","reply_tweet_id":"1809371964576031190","tags":["smallpoems"],"body_html":"<p>@RealisticPoetry Also an algorithm problem.<br><br>Twitter hates lists, and sometimes, most times, poems are considered lists.<br><br>We have been running the hashtag #smallpoems now for, gosh I think ten years, you need to cultivate a supportive writing community<br><br>Majority of poetry should suck, math</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1809373857268240465","display_date":"July 05, 2024 · 23:48 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
