{"id":"twitter:1809225563762024864","tweet_id":"1809225563762024864","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1809225563762024864","title":"Woke up and thought I was doing way better. Breath returned and just a sore throat. Figured I use my self-quarantine to catch up on Wikipedia edits. W","summary":"Woke up and thought I was doing way better. Breath returned and just a sore throat. Figured I use my self-quarantine to catch up on Wikipedia edits. Wrote one sentence... And no I am not better... The cognitive energy wiped me out. Forget how exhausting editing can be.","date":"2024-07-05","published":"2024-07-05T13:59:22+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Woke up and thought I was doing way better. Breath returned and just a sore throat.<br><br>Figured I use my self-quarantine to catch up on Wikipedia edits.<br><br>Wrote one sentence... And no I am not better... The cognitive energy wiped me out.<br><br>Forget how exhausting editing can be.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1809225563762024864","display_date":"July 05, 2024 · 13:59 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
